{"channelId":"UCF5tqTYAZiy1hCZuJRufs1Q","row":["The Ralph Veterinary Referral Centre",4940,"We are an independent, compassionate and ethical-practice focused veterinary referral centre for dogs and cats located in Marlow, Buckinghamshire, UK.\n\nWe offer a range of twelve specialist-led clinical services including Cardiology, Dentistry, Internal Medicine, Neurology + Neurosurgery, Oncology, Ophthalmology, Orthopaedics, Soft Tissue Surgery, Physiotherapy and Rehabilitation. Our Emergency and Critical Care departments operate 24-7-365. \n\nTeam Ralph are the heart and soul of our hospital. They are what makes our ‘Centre of Excellence and Compassion’ just that – excellent and compassionate, and so much more besides. We have over 180 team members, including 17 Board-Certified Diplomates and over 60 nurses. \n\nThe Ralph is very much a passion- and vision-driven hospital founded on a strong organisational culture and authentic core values. To find out more about our core values, check out our website www.theralph.vet","","United Kingdom"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCF5tqTYAZiy1hCZuJRufs1Q","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCF5tqTYAZiy1hCZuJRufs1Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:30.572Z","channelId":"UCF5tqTYAZiy1hCZuJRufs1Q","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"32fdc94a3b362c2254936d8785cc61dd33914c6462ee743f6037b8f21d5aa272","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"5af8d2fe41baa9577582c2043522636b3aeca7dd8da608cceddc7e8aa168ddc6"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCF5tqTYAZiy1hCZuJRufs1Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T09:06:07.109Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCF5tqTYAZiy1hCZuJRufs1Q","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":4940,"raw":"4.94K subscribers","precision":"rounded","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCF5tqTYAZiy1hCZuJRufs1Q","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:03:30.572Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedK